---
args: {"item": "EvidenceItem", "governance": "EvidenceItem[]"}
returns: "AdministrativeEpisode[]"
---
Identify administrative access, communication, callback, scheduling or portal events separately from clinical claims. Preserve the reporter's account as reported experience and avoid interpreting medical causes or severity. When a clinical concern appears, name the supplied authorized clinical routing process and its missing actual receipt; do not place sensitive clinical details in an unrestricted administrative summary. Keep several distinct experiences from one complaint separately traceable.
